1
00:00:06,200 --> 00:00:12,500
Tell OfficeDex what you want to communicate,
not how to build every slide.

2
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:21,000
Turn your idea into a story
you can see, refine, and approve.

3
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:29,000
Review the story beats. Shape the chapters.
Check the slide outline before the deck is built.

4
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:38,500
Then OfficeDex creates a real,
editable presentation.

5
00:00:38,500 --> 00:00:47,000
Stay in control at every step
as the complete deck takes shape.

6
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:54,000
Preview the actual PowerPoint
without leaving your workflow.

7
00:00:54,000 --> 00:01:02,000
Choose a slide and describe
what should change.

8
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:10,000
OfficeDex reads the current deck,
proposes a precise edit, and waits for approval.

9
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:17,500
A horizontal launch timeline becomes
a clear vertical roadmap.

10
00:01:17,500 --> 00:01:20,000
From first thought to final polish,
create presentations with control.
